			y: 2.0d,
			title: "A crew of four",
			description: ["Up to three builders with nothing to do join a build near their table, so a crew of four finishes in under a third of the time. A Builder's Workshop (next chapter) is a home for one more.", "", "Busy builders also queue up to five more blueprints and build them in order."],
