			title: "Your own builds: the Scan Tool",
			description: ["A Blank Blueprint and a spyglass make a Scan Tool. Right-click two opposite corners of something you built, then sneak-right-click the air: you get a blueprint of it, and it's in the Blueprint Table for everyone.", "", "Rename the tool in an anvil first to name the build."],
